graph GENERAL_SECURITY 1
entry GENERAL-SECURITY-001

gate GENERAL-SECURITY-001
context CODE_CHANGE
question "Are inputs, permissions, secrets, private data, and isolation handled within the admitted security boundary?"
evidence threats,permissions,secrets,isolation
YES GENERAL-SECURITY-002
NO GENERAL-HARD-STOP
UNKNOWN GENERAL-HARD-STOP
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-HARD-STOP
end

gate GENERAL-SECURITY-002
context CLOSURE
question "Are destructive, external, and release actions held for Runtime authority with an exact bounded request?"
evidence authority,actions,request
YES GENERAL-COMPLETE
NO GENERAL-HARD-STOP
UNKNOWN GENERAL-HARD-STOP
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-HARD-STOP
end

terminal GENERAL-COMPLETE COMPLETE "The security and authority boundary is satisfied."
terminal GENERAL-HARD-STOP HARD_STOP "Security or authority evidence failed."

